// Tests: a small PKI made with OpenSSL. Test Root (RSA-2048) signs Test
// Intermediate (P-384, pathlen 0), which signs example.test (P-256, SHA-384;
// DNS example.test and *.wild.test, IP 127.0.0.1). The root also signs an
// Ed25519 leaf with RSA-PSS, and Constrained (permitted DNS good.test),
// which signs www.good.test and www.evil.test.
